@startuml
left to right direction

title Use Case Diagram for AI-Powered Analysis & Insights System

rectangle "System" {
  usecase "CFR001: View Financial Insights Dashboard" as CFR001
  usecase "SAFR001: Manage Analysis Parameters" as SAFR001
  usecase "FAFR002: View Client Intervention Alerts" as FAFR002
  usecase "CFR003: View Financial Predictions" as CFR003
  usecase "CFR004: Receive Personalized Recommendations" as CFR004
  usecase "SAFR005: Request Spending Limit Alerts" as SAFR005
  usecase "FAFR001: Manage Client Mentoring Sessions" as FAFR001
  usecase "CFR006: View Investment Opportunities" as CFR006
  usecase "SFR009: Request Contextualized News Insights" as SFR009
  usecase "AIFR002: Generate Personalized Recommendations" as AIFR002
  usecase "CFR010: Manage Relationship with Financial Advisors" as CFR010

  Client --> CFR001 : View financial data consolidated in a dashboard.
  SysAdmin --> SAFR001 : Configure system parameters for accuracy and compliance.
  User --> FAFR002 : Receive alerts when client needs professional attention.
  Client --> CFR003 : Access future financial trends based on history and market.
  Client --> CFR004 : Get tailored advice aligned with personal goals.
  SysAdmin --> SAFR005 : Set spending limits to control budget overruns.
  FinancialAdvisor --> FAFR001 : Schedule mentoring sessions using system insights.
  Client --> CFR006 : See investment options matching risk profile and ESG preferences.
  System --> SFR009 : Provide relevant news based on portfolio composition.
  AIFR002 --> User : Offer personalized financial guidance via the system.
  SysAdmin --> SAFR001 <|-- (CFR004) : Admin can adjust recommendation settings per client's KYC profile.
  Client --> CFR007 : View investment opportunities suitable to risk profile.
  Client --> SFR009 : Access contextualized news related to investments.
}

@enduml